 authors received no specific funding for this study.</p></fn><fn id="ack3" fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing interests.</bold> MAE, KK, DAP, KLG, RS, LG, KAVM, and CTL are employed by the company that makes the array chips analyzed. PCN, LZ, and SSM are former employees.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>